WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.230
5x minus 7 equals 18. Where do you start?

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:10.440
Adding or taking away the same amount on both sides keeps it true.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.380
Undo the minus 7 by adding 7 to both sides.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.190
Picture it on the balance: 5 x blocks against 25 units.

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:22.670
Now undo times 5 by dividing by 5.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:28.010
Undo in reverse order, same move on both sides. x is 5.
